cleId IdType="pmc">PMC3328121</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">22529840</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Kerby RL, Ludden PW, Roberts GP. Carbon monoxide-dependent growth of Rhodospirillum rubrum. J Bacteriol. 1995;177:2241&#x2013;4. doi: 10.1128/jb.177.8.2241-2244.1995.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1128/jb.177.8.2241-2244.1995</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC176875</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">7721719</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Fox JD, He Y, Shelver D, Roberts GP, Ludden PW. Characterization of the region encoding the CO-induced hydrogenase of Rhodospirillum rubrum. J Bacteriol. 1996;178:6200&#x2013;8. doi: 10.1128/jb.178.21.6200-6208.1996.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1128/jb.178.21.6200-6208.1996</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC178490</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">8892819</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Hussain A, Bruant G, Mehta P, Raghavan V, Tartakovsky B, Guiot SR. Population analysis of mesophilic microbial fuel cells fed with carbon monoxide. Appl Biochem Biotechnol. 2014;172:713&#x2013;26. doi: 10.1007/s12010-013-0556-9.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1007/s12010-013-0556-9</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">24122627</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Mosbaek F, Kjeldal H, Mulat DG, Albertsen M, Ward AJ, Feilberg A, et al. Identification of syntrophic acetate-oxidizing bacteria in anaerobic digesters by combined protein-based stable isotope probing and metagenomics. ISME J. 2016;10:2405&#x2013;18. doi: 10.1038/ismej.2016.39.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1038/ismej.2016.39</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC5030692</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">27128991</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Can M, Armstrong FA, Ragsdale SW. Structure, function, and mechanism of the nickel metalloenzymes, C